                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really fun for kids or adults, brings back a lot of Disney nostalgia (no one in the game is staring at their smart phones, coordinating their lightning lane schedules). There are no Disney adults in crop tops and booty shorts filming TikToks in front of the castle. It's so fun. The ambient noise is relaxing and the games within the rides are pretty fun. Play it while eating a churro.",
